<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow"><title>Billing · Attested Memory</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/app.css?v=20260909a"></head>
<body>
  <header class="top"><a class="brand" href="/">attested<span>memory</span><i> / billing</i></a><nav class="nav"><a href="/memory">Memory</a><a href="/teams">Teams</a><a href="/market">Market</a><a href="/docs">Guide</a><a href="/use-cases">Use cases</a><a href="/developers">Developers</a></nav><span class="pill">USDC · Base</span></header>
  <main class="wrap">
    <div class="hero"><div class="eyebrow" data-i18n="billingEyebrow">Crypto checkout · non-custodial</div><h1><span class="hero-lead" data-i18n="billingTitleLead">Access in</span> <span data-i18n="billingTitleAccent">one exact payment.</span></h1><p data-i18n="billingBody">Select a plan, enter a public wallet address, send exact canonical USDC, and let KOVA verify Base finality. The Gateway issues access automatically; your checkout can recover the key for 48 hours.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/start" data-i18n="start">Setup wizard</a><a class="btn alt" href="/capabilities" data-i18n="openCapabilities">Understand KOVA</a></div></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card"><span class="tag" data-i18n="billingFreeTag">Free trial</span><h3 data-i18n="billingFreeTitle">7–14 days free</h3><p data-i18n="billingFreeBody">No wallet payment. One cryptographically actor-bound trial per product.</p><a class="btn" href="/memory?trial=1" data-i18n="billingFreeCta">Start trial</a></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="tag">Personal</span><h3 data-i18n="billingPersonalPrice">$12 / month</h3><p>Personal Attested Memory Pro.</p><button class="btn buy" type="button" data-plan="personal.pro.monthly" data-i18n="billingPersonalCta">Choose Personal</button></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="tag" data-i18n="teams">Teams</span><h3 data-i18n="billingTeamPrice">$49 / month</h3><p>Team Memory OS Standard.</p><button class="btn buy" type="button" data-plan="team.standard.monthly" data-i18n="billingTeamCta">Choose Team</button></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="tag" data-i18n="market">Market</span><h3 data-i18n="billingMarketPrice">$29 / 7 days</h3><p>Expert Memory Market pass.</p><button class="btn buy" type="button" data-plan="expert.pass.7d" data-i18n="billingMarketCta">Choose Market</button></article>
    </div>
    <section class="section"><div class="flow"><div class="flow-step"><b data-i18n="billingFlowCreate">01 · CREATE</b><strong data-i18n="billingExactInvoice">Exact invoice</strong><span data-i18n="billingCreateBody">Plan, payer, recipient, token and amount are fixed.</span></div><div class="flow-step"><b data-i18n="billingFlowPay">02 · PAY</b><strong>USDC on Base</strong><span data-i18n="billingPayBody">Funds go from buyer wallet directly to the configured recipient.</span></div><div class="flow-step"><b data-i18n="billingFlowVerify">03 · VERIFY</b><strong data-i18n="billingKovaFinality">KOVA finality</strong><span data-i18n="billingVerifyBody">Exact transfer and required confirmations are checked.</span></div><div class="flow-step"><b data-i18n="billingFlowIssue">04 · ISSUE</b><strong data-i18n="billingScopedKey">Scoped ask_ key</strong><span data-i18n="billingIssueBody">Gateway grants only the purchased product and duration.</span></div></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="footer"><span data-i18n="billingSafety">Never share a wallet private key or seed phrase.</span><a href="/docs" data-i18n="guide">User guide →</a></footer>

  <dialog id="trial-dialog"><div class="modal"><div class="modal-head"><div><div class="eyebrow" data-i18n="trialEyebrow">Free trial · actor-bound</div><h2 id="trial-title" data-i18n="trialStart">Start free</h2></div><button class="close" data-close="trial-dialog" aria-label="Close" data-i18n-aria="closeAria">×</button></div><p id="trial-description" data-i18n="trialDefaultDesc">Your browser creates a cryptographic actor identity. Its private signing key remains in this browser.</p><button class="btn" id="claim-trial" data-i18n="trialClaim">Create trial key</button><p class="notice" id="trial-status" role="status"></p><div class="checkout-box" id="trial-keybox" hidden><strong data-i18n="trialKeyLabel">Trial access key</strong><code id="trial-key"></code><div class="key-actions"><button class="btn alt copy-key" data-target="trial-key" data-i18n="copyKey">Copy key</button><a class="btn alt" href="/memory" data-i18n="memoryContinueStudio">Continue to studio</a></div></div></div></dialog>

  <dialog id="checkout-dialog"><div class="modal"><div class="modal-head"><div><div class="eyebrow" data-i18n="checkoutEyebrow">Protected checkout · Base</div><h2 id="checkout-title" data-i18n="checkoutBuy">Buy access</h2></div><button class="close" data-close="checkout-dialog" aria-label="Close" data-i18n-aria="closeAria">×</button></div><form id="order-form"><div class="field-label"><label for="payer" data-i18n="payerLabel">Your public wallet address</label><button class="info-tip" type="button" aria-label="Why a public wallet address?" data-i18n-aria="payerHelpAria">?<span role="tooltip" data-i18n="payerHelp">Public address only. We never ask for a seed phrase or private key.</span></button></div><input id="payer" required pattern="0x[0-9a-fA-F]{40}" placeholder="0x…" autocomplete="off"><button class="btn" type="submit" data-i18n="createInvoice">Create exact USDC invoice</button></form><div id="payment" hidden><div class="checkout-box"><p><span data-i18n="sendExactly">Send exactly</span> <strong id="amount"></strong> <span data-i18n="usdcBaseTo">USDC on Base to:</span></p><code id="recipient"></code><div class="key-actions"><a id="wallet" class="btn alt" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-i18n="openWallet">Open wallet</a><button class="btn alt copy-key" data-target="recipient" data-i18n="copyAddress">Copy address</button></div><p class="notice"><span data-i18n="kovaCheckoutNote">KOVA checks the canonical token, payer, recipient, exact amount and finality. Never send a private key.</span> <a href="/capabilities" data-i18n="whySeparate">Why KOVA is separate →</a></p></div><div class="field-label"><label for="tx" data-i18n="txLabel">Transaction hash</label><button class="info-tip" type="button" aria-label="What is a transaction hash?" data-i18n-aria="txHelpAria">?<span role="tooltip" data-i18n="txHelp">A public transaction identifier. It is not a wallet secret and does not prove payment until verified.</span></button></div><input id="tx" placeholder="0x…" autocomplete="off"><button class="btn" id="confirm" type="button" data-i18n="verifyPayment">Verify payment</button><p class="notice" id="payment-status" role="status"></p></div><div class="checkout-box" id="paid-keybox" hidden><strong data-i18n="accessReady">Access ready</strong><code id="paid-key"></code><p class="notice" data-i18n="keyRecoveryNote">Recovery through this checkout is available for 48 hours. Store the key in a password manager or secret vault; it is not persisted by this page.</p><div class="key-actions"><button class="btn copy-key" data-target="paid-key" data-i18n="copyKey">Copy key</button><a class="btn alt" href="/memory" data-i18n="memoryContinueStudio">Continue to studio</a></div></div></div></dialog>

  <script src="/app.js?v=20260909a"></script>
  <script src="/actor.js?v=20260909f"></script>
  <script src="/checkout.js?v=20260909a"></script>
</body>
</html>
